+
+# 2026-09-25-assistant-accounting-status
+
+English | [中文](2026-09-25-assistant-accounting-status.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+Adds optional provider-neutral accounting and model-status snapshots to settled assistant events and their terminal stream metadata.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Declaration](#declaration)
+- [Compatibility](#compatibility)
+- [Verification](#verification)
+- [Dev Note](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## Declaration
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-09-25-assistant-accounting-status
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:assistant/attempt"
+    previous: "2026-09-16-session-format-v4"
+    after: "45302a9dcf250b6fc3cb77f9ed1af8cd0ab9440c60a01a8b93e6b3f01888fd79"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:assistant/message"
+    previous: "2026-09-16-session-format-v4"
+    after: "275630f738bf3c4375b8edea2c9cb710602bd2a5a11337eff7a8cd695181984f"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## Compatibility
+
+Existing V4 records remain valid because every field is optional. Older V4 readers ignore the extra diagnostic fields; replay and model-visible message derivation do not depend on accounting or statuses. Current readers validate agreement between terminal stream metadata and the top-level settlement snapshots.
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## Verification
+
+pnpm exec vitest run packages/llm/llm/tests/accounting.spec.ts packages/llm/llm/tests/status.spec.ts packages/llm/token-meter/tests/cost-projection.spec.ts packages/llm/token-meter/tests/turn-cost.spec.ts packages/session/session-persistence-jsonl/tests/generation.spec.ts: 105 tests passed.
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## Dev Note
+
+None.
